                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "621019f8-c3ed-3219-b39f-7fc942b179e0",
                        "entry_id": "1879ec1a-6885-3b33-8cc3-60b30e96261b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a goodly way; courteously, graciously."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d880e135-0516-489a-b9bf-7cfd23326b37",
                                "sense_id": "621019f8-c3ed-3219-b39f-7fc942b179e0",
                                "text": "Thenne he sente for the thre knyghtes & they came afore hym / and he cryed hem mercy of that he had done to them / and they forgaf hit hym goodely and he dyed anone",
                                "translation": "Then he sent for the three knights and they came before him, and he pleaded with them to have mercy for what he had done to them, and they graciously forgave him for it and he died soon after.",
                                "english": "Then he sent for the three knights and they came before him, and he pleaded with them to have mercy for what he had done to them, and they graciously forgave him for it and he died soon after."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e4d5c9e-c818-40e3-b907-7de9ccb46f4a",
                                "sense_id": "621019f8-c3ed-3219-b39f-7fc942b179e0",
                                "text": "Goodly she entertaind those noble knights, / And brought them vp into her castle hall […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6216da7-0c8f-3bfa-886b-105ea029b10f",
                        "entry_id": "1879ec1a-6885-3b33-8cc3-60b30e96261b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Well; excellently."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dialectal",
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7f8258b-ade7-40f1-9f04-9bd36c19afb6",
                                "sense_id": "c6216da7-0c8f-3bfa-886b-105ea029b10f",
                                "text": "For love of vertue and of martial praise;\nTo which though nobly ye inclined are,\n(As goodlie well ye shew'd in late assaies)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffc75c1e-dc50-4415-8408-a91937623715",
                                "sense_id": "c6216da7-0c8f-3bfa-886b-105ea029b10f",
                                "text": "I know doin' marriage is tough and hard to pull off for a long time, but from what I has been led to believe, you two was doin' it quite goodly. As goodly as a huntin' shootin' fishin' filmin' drinkin' Englishy can do with a gyratin' pumpin' singin' lookin' wearinv Yankee-doodle icon. It was seemin' to be good together."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
